<h2 id="about-the-bakersfield-50501-movement">ABOUT THE BAKERSFIELD 50501 MOVEMENT</h2>

<p><strong>50501 (50 Protests, 50 States, 1 Movement)</strong> is a national grassroots movement launched to protest the policies and actions of the second Trump administration. Since February 2025, 50501 has led three mass mobilizations, drawing thousands to state capitols and city halls across America.</p>

<p>This movement is powered by regular people – not politicians. From small towns to big cities, we’re organizing, marching, and building a future rooted in justice, equity, and collective power.</p>

<p>We are your neighbors—parents, workers, students, and community members coming together to build a better Bakersfield. We’re passionate volunteers advocating for progress, equity, and hope. <strong>This movement belongs to all of us.</strong></p>

